\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Glimmerdeep: Chaos Reigns to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Gather rare gemstones.","Glimmerdeep: Prized Gemstones","Gathered rare gemstones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","You have gathered rare gemstones."},
[5814]={"Wandering glooms move along the river Gladden.","A strange darkness has come to the Vales of Anduin. Wandering glooms move along the river Gladden. These creatures should be defeated if the Vales are to remain safe.","You have defeated many wandering glooms along the river Gladden, making the Vales of Anduin safer.","Wandering glooms can be found along the river Gladden.\
\
You should defeat wandering glooms.","Defeated many wandering glooms.","Gloom over the Gladden","Completado","Defeat wandering glooms (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated wandering glooms (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[5815]={"You should return to Zádokh Flint-eye and apprise him of your efforts.","'Careful now, on your journeys.'","You ran out of time...","Defeat Drôk-and-Kharb","'What is this? You have slain a high ranking two-headed troll? I praise you for your efforts and your talents, ${CLASS}.'","Defeat Drôk-and-Kharb.","Gloomingtarn: Drôk-and-Kharb","Talk to Zádokh Flint-eye","Defeated Drôk-and-Kharb","'Deep within the caverns of Gloomingtarn are rich mineral deposits. The journey there is not an easy one. However, we need the flint there for the fires and forges. Are you willing to take on this task?'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest. This quest can be completed with one or two adventurers.</rgb>","Mineral riches await those who brave the craggy caverns of Gloomingtarn.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>"},
