[5990]={"'Deface Gunnberg's tribute piles...that should grab his attention.'","Tribute-piles can be found outside Gunnberg's lair, south of Zudrugund.\
\
Frithgeir has asked you to seek out Gunnberg's tribute-piles and destroy them.","Frithgeir is at Zudrugund, north of the giant-ruins. \
\
You should return to Frithgeir with news of Gunnberg's defeat.","'Gunnberg, the chieftain of the giants, sits atop the cliffs, ruling his people with an iron fist.  This monster has led his people to destroy our home, pillage our sacred resting places, and deface the beauty of our ancient craftsmanship.\
\
'He does, however, have a weakness: it is said that the Algraig clans pay tribute to him to allay his wrath. He will likely emerge from his lair if his tribute is disturbed. \
\
'Gunnberg makes his home in the small mountain pass, in the southern reaches of Thrór's Coomb. This pass leads to one of the few entrances of the dwarf-halls below.'","Destroy tribute-piles (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Gunnberg must be defeated and his people routed from this vale.'","Defeated Gunnberg","Gunnberg's Folly","Gunnberg's personal tribute-pile lies outside his home in a small mountain pass.\
\
Frithgeir has asked you to disturb Gunnberg's personal tribute-pile and draw him forth to battle.","Disturb the tribute-pile and defeat Gunnberg","Talk to Frithgeir at Zudrugund","'Gunnberg's defeat may serve as a lesson to those who would despoil our home.\
\
'Perhaps the giants will return from whence they came.'","Among the ruins, Gunnberg, chieftain of the giants, rules over his people. It is rumoured that his appetite for violence is only overshadowed by his lust for tribute.","Destroyed tribute-piles  (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[5991]={"Derrota a Gurthagar","'Ahhh... una vida, plena y vigorosa. Déjame devorarte. Drenaré todo lo que tengas, todo lo que eres.'","Has derrotado a uno de los líderes de las fuerzas del mal en los Campos de Fornost.","Has derrotado a Gurthagar, uno de los líderes de las fuerzas del mal en los Campos de Fornost.","Gurthagar, el segador de vida","Completado","Has encontrado a Gurthagar, una presencia aterradora en los Campos de Fornost...","Has expulsado a Gurthagar","Gurthagar se encuentra al este de los Campos de Fornost, cerca de Amon Amrûn.\
\
Debes derrotar a Gurthagar, ya que este ser ha drenado la vida de los Campos de Fornost","Un gran terror te estremece hasta los huesos.\
\
Te has topado con Gurthagar, una presencia aterradora en los Campos de Fornost. Este ser fantasmagórico se ha fortalecido al arrebatar la vida a las tierras que le rodean."},
[5992]={"Clean up the detritus (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'We would love to share our culture, but that is not very easy to do now. These freebooters and scoundrels roam the city as if they own the land. They leave behind debris and detritus and create an ill look for the city. Our businesses cannot thrive in such an environment.\
\
'Would you help clean up the detritus around Râhal Bakh? There is an area that is most troubled by this mess. We call it The Gut because that is where all the ruffians leave their waste.'","You have cleaned up most of the mess in the Gut. You should tell Ahûzath about this.","Gut Health","Detritus spots cleaned (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Did you actually do this? I was just complaining into the wind. I did not actually believe someone would try to clean up the Gut.\
\
'The Corsairs and pirates will most likely take it as an insult and probably leave even more waste behind... but I cannot blame you for a good deed.\
\
'Thank you for listening to my ramblings and acting upon it.'","Talk to Ahûzath","Ahûzath is concerned about the state of Umbar with swaths of freebooters and Corsairs roaming around.","Ahûzath has asked you to clean up all the detritus in the Gut."},
[5993]={"'I think that you have secured the watch-tower, so perhaps now would be a good time to help Guto as well. He told me that he would be making camp not far from here -- to the south-east, I believe.\
\
'Guto means to scout a place on the map you brought us. It would seem the Dragon-clan are amassing there, for all of their tactics seem to branch from it.\
\
'If you find Guto, you may be able to help him thwart the violence of the Dragon-clan.'","Guto's Own Investigation","'I did not expect to see you here, ${PLAYER}. I thought you only worked for my grandfather. But perhaps we can actually accomplish something now that you have come to assist me!'","Guto has made camp south-east of the watch-tower in Trum Dreng.\
\
You should seek out Guto and help him track the Dragon-clan chieftain who has stirred up so much trouble.","Guto has ventured on his own mission to track and hunt the Dragon-clan invaders who seem to be pressing on all sides in Trum Dreng.","'I hope that you can be of help to Guto. He would be wise not to let his rashness guide him at such times as these.'","Find Guto at his encampment"},
}
